# Update local server automatically

When you finish implementing, fixing, or changing this project (frontend, backend, shared, or Docker-related files), rebuild and restart the local server without waiting for the user to ask.

Use:

```bash
docker compose -f docker-compose.yml -f docker-compose.dev.yml up -d --build
```

Then confirm `http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/health` is ok.

Skip only for pure questions, docs, or when no runtime code changed. Do not push or commit as part of this step.
